## Why This Is Asked
Interview context explanation.

## Key Concepts
- CRD design for RegionTrafficPolicy
- Per-namespace traffic steering
- Mesh policy translation (Istio/Linkerd)
- Egress gateways and failover
- Observability: metrics, traces, SLAs
- Drift detection and reconciliation
- Safe rollback via versioned policies
- Testing multi-region failure scenarios

